WEBVTT

00:00:30.390 --> 00:00:31.190
It passed me?

00:00:37.210 --> 00:00:39.070
They still have rampant cars?

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:43.040
Haven't they finished debugging the navigation software in America?

00:00:43.410 --> 00:00:45.900
It can't be helped, it's a big country.

00:00:46.010 --> 00:00:49.070
Even with the introduction of the emergency stop system has eliminated accidents caused by rampant cars,

00:00:49.150 --> 00:00:52.180
a situational analysis system is still necessary.

00:00:53.690 --> 00:00:57.680
Can you believe that the first thing we have to do after landing in the US is pursue a rampant car?

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:01.520
There should be eX-Drivers here as well...

00:01:03.970 --> 00:01:05.460
So, what do we do?

00:01:05.530 --> 00:01:08.500
We cut the satellite feed to the S-Line reciever.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:12.000
After that, the only thing left is to take out the individual sensors.

00:01:12.070 --> 00:01:15.740
Just like before, we should be able to stop it via conventional methods.

00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:17.670
Alright!

00:01:17.750 --> 00:01:21.010
I'm going to show them the spirit of the Japanese eX-Drivers!

00:01:21.620 --> 00:01:22.980
We're gonna need to get onto the highway...

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:23.810
Let's finish it off there!

00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:25.110
Roger!

00:01:36.360 --> 00:01:37.410
So fast.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:41.260
I'm gonna get in front of it and slow its movements.

00:01:41.340 --> 00:01:42.030
Here we go!

00:01:49.080 --> 00:01:51.240
Damn, it's heading downtown!

00:01:51.310 --> 00:01:53.110
You're not getting away!

00:01:57.390 --> 00:01:58.750
I love you, Darling...

00:01:58.820 --> 00:02:00.950
I thank my lucky stars every day that I met you.

00:02:01.320 --> 00:02:04.050
Our love is going to continue forever.

00:02:04.130 --> 00:02:06.220
Yes, just like this highway.

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:10.200
Yes!  Go, go!  Just keep on going nonstop!

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.210
Fucker!  I'm in a hurry!

00:02:23.280 --> 00:02:24.370
You can't just stop us for no reason!

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:27.680
It looks like a rampant AI car has entered downtown.

00:02:28.550 --> 00:02:30.570
Those aren't David's and Kelly's cars.

00:02:31.350 --> 00:02:33.150
Where are those eX-Drivers from?

00:03:11.260 --> 00:03:12.250
Lisa, that's the wrong side!

00:03:18.730 --> 00:03:20.530
Oh, shit...

00:03:20.730 --> 00:03:22.130
What the hell are you doing?!

00:03:22.200 --> 00:03:25.540
It's not my fault!  This is my first time driving in America.

00:03:25.640 --> 00:03:27.940
There's a reason your steering-wheel is on the left side!

00:03:28.010 --> 00:03:29.440
Shut up already!

00:03:30.540 --> 00:03:33.480
Please, concentrate on the target.

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:36.710
Don't worry, Lorna-san.  I won't let it get away this time.

00:03:36.780 --> 00:03:37.980
Very well, then.

00:04:13.850 --> 00:04:15.580
Hey, get ahold of yourself!

00:04:18.550 --> 00:04:19.690
Ow...

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:20.630
Are you okay?

00:04:20.690 --> 00:04:21.750
What the hell'd you do that for?

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.330
Those are gasoline cars!

00:04:30.910 --> 00:04:31.840
H-Hey!

00:04:57.260 --> 00:04:59.200
Damn, they got it before us!

00:04:59.270 --> 00:05:00.360
Oh no!

00:05:00.870 --> 00:05:01.960
David...

00:05:02.040 --> 00:05:05.300
Using that tone of voice and attitude just for an overblown motor makes me sick.

00:05:05.370 --> 00:05:06.840
Now just hold on a sec, Kelly...

00:05:06.910 --> 00:05:10.040
Stop talking like that and please give us another try.

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:11.240
NO!

00:05:11.310 --> 00:05:13.940
For crying out loud, why the hell did we spend 5 hours talking about this?!

00:05:14.010 --> 00:05:16.040
You were drunk weren't you?!

00:05:14.520 --> 00:05:16.280
5 hours?

00:05:16.040 --> 00:05:17.110
No, of course I wasn't.

00:05:16.350 --> 00:05:17.840
They're eX-Drivers, huh?

00:05:17.110 --> 00:05:17.910
So why don't you stop!?

00:05:17.910 --> 00:05:18.530
I did stop!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:18.910
Looks like it...

00:05:18.530 --> 00:05:20.320
Well then, just quit it right here.

00:05:32.970 --> 00:05:34.400
Hi, thanks for coming out here.

00:05:34.700 --> 00:05:36.830
Take it from here, please.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:43.410
For violations of California State Law, we are placing you under arrest.

00:05:43.480 --> 00:05:45.270
We're taking you in.

00:05:46.280 --> 00:05:47.040
Lorna!

00:05:47.110 --> 00:05:48.410
What's the meaning of this?!

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:51.340
What the?!  State Law violation?

00:05:51.720 --> 00:05:53.350
Let go of me!

00:05:53.790 --> 00:05:56.650
We were helping the police!

00:05:56.720 --> 00:05:58.780
You should be grateful for our presence!

00:05:59.430 --> 00:06:01.550
You are interfering with police business.  I'm bringing you in as well.

00:06:01.630 --> 00:06:03.760
Stop it~!

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:13.400
I came to pick you up, Angela.

00:06:13.940 --> 00:06:18.110
That's not right, to worry your father like this...

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:21.840
If he's so worried, why didn't he come meet me himself...?

00:06:21.920 --> 00:06:25.080
He's very busy with his work.  Please try to understand.

00:06:26.340 --> 00:06:28.820
Yes, I understand.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:53.640
I never thought that our first night in America would be spent sitting in a police station.

00:06:53.710 --> 00:06:55.150
Me neither.

00:06:55.750 --> 00:07:00.510
In California, they don't allow cars with steering wheels on the right side to be used.

00:07:00.590 --> 00:07:02.850
Could you tell me what century that law is from?

00:07:03.120 --> 00:07:06.030
It's okay, though.  We've fixed that misunderstanding now.

00:07:03.300 --> 00:07:06.140
Then, we'll take the bus back to my home...

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:09.890
Who the hell are you guys?

00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:12.830
Reeks like gasoline.

00:07:12.900 --> 00:07:14.700
You guys are eX-Drivers, aren't you?

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.930
What's it to ya?!

00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:18.900
This is inadvisable, Detective Ralph.

00:07:18.970 --> 00:07:23.370
My aunt's cousin was prosecuted on charges of  sexual harassment for just touching.

00:07:23.580 --> 00:07:28.480
Ah, and then, my grandfather's younger brother once had to defend himself for being lured in for tea...

00:07:26.450 --> 00:07:28.140
What was that about?

00:07:33.350 --> 00:07:34.480
Hi~!

00:07:34.560 --> 00:07:38.190
To all of the 1.5 billion eX-Driver fans in the entire world...

00:07:38.270 --> 00:07:39.330
This is Cayne Tokioka.

00:07:39.940 --> 00:07:42.870
Finally, it's begun, the eX-Driver World Tournament!

00:07:42.940 --> 00:07:45.100
eX-Drivers from all over the world have gathered...

00:07:45.170 --> 00:07:48.770
...at this carnival to show off their internationally famous cars and magnificent techniques.

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:52.240
Here in Santa Monica, it's about to heat, Heat, HEAT UP!

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:00.480
At last the exhibition performance has started on the circuit, right before the final race.

00:08:00.560 --> 00:08:03.790
Finally, the eX-vision performance starts!

00:08:09.900 --> 00:08:12.830
Look!  This magnificent drive technique!

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:14.600
This is what it means to be an eX-Driver!

00:08:15.140 --> 00:08:18.900
It's truly the world's best entertainment!

00:08:21.840 --> 00:08:24.900
That Ogawa-san...  He just modifies the car as he sees fit.

00:08:25.580 --> 00:08:27.110
I was fine with the old one...

00:08:27.820 --> 00:08:30.080
Why am I the alternate?

00:08:30.150 --> 00:08:31.680
We don't have a choice about it.

00:08:31.750 --> 00:08:34.720
We DID lose the preliminary race in Japan.

00:08:34.790 --> 00:08:36.420
That was your fault!

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:40.990
The Stratos crashed because your Super 7 hit me.

00:08:41.060 --> 00:08:42.620
What the hell are you saying?!

00:08:42.700 --> 00:08:45.720
You hit me, what with all your reckless driving.

00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:48.500
Now look here, are your complaning about my driving style?!

00:08:48.900 --> 00:08:50.630
I was just speaking the truth.

00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:51.640
What?!

00:08:51.840 --> 00:08:52.930
What do you want?!

00:08:53.010 --> 00:08:54.310
Stop it, you two.

00:08:55.210 --> 00:08:58.240
I will try my best for both you and Souichi.

00:08:58.310 --> 00:08:59.640
That's alright, isn't it?

00:08:59.650 --> 00:08:59.860
Hmmph!

00:09:01.180 --> 00:09:02.670
You guys!

00:09:02.750 --> 00:09:04.740
You must be the team representing Japan.

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:06.250
Ah, thanks for your help last night.

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:07.690
I'm Kelly.

00:09:07.760 --> 00:09:08.720
Don't be too hard on me, alright?

00:09:08.790 --> 00:09:09.420
Sure.

00:09:09.490 --> 00:09:11.930
Kelly, he's here!  Hurry up and get this done.

00:09:12.190 --> 00:09:13.890
He'll be mad!

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:17.930
There's someone I want to introduce you to.

00:09:18.000 --> 00:09:18.970
Come with me for just a minute, won't ya?

00:09:19.700 --> 00:09:20.330
Who?

00:09:20.400 --> 00:09:21.130
It'll be fine...

00:09:21.170 --> 00:09:24.470
The one that's going to take the top is me, David.

00:09:24.540 --> 00:09:28.940
Yes, that's right.  Our American team is the best eX-Driver team in the world.

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:29.510
That's him.

00:09:29.880 --> 00:09:33.250
The fact that I can sponsor such talented people...

00:09:33.320 --> 00:09:35.370
...makes me proud.

00:09:35.750 --> 00:09:37.580
Mr. Rico Gambino...

00:09:37.650 --> 00:09:41.820
I'm going to prove to you that your investment was correct!

00:09:43.090 --> 00:09:44.510
Mr. Gambino...

00:09:44.510 --> 00:09:46.270
Allow me to introduce these people to you.

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:47.640
This is the team representing Japan.

00:09:49.010 --> 00:09:51.780
Last night, they rescued your daughter Angela.

00:09:54.820 --> 00:09:56.450
I thank you guys.

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:58.220
I thank you from the bottom of my heart.

00:09:58.590 --> 00:10:01.990
Mr. Gambino is the American team sponsor.

00:10:02.060 --> 00:10:05.090
He operates a chain of supermarkets.

00:10:07.830 --> 00:10:09.060
Do you like pasta?

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:10.130
Pasta?

00:10:10.200 --> 00:10:11.640
That's spaghetti.

00:10:11.700 --> 00:10:13.030
Meat sauce?

00:10:13.110 --> 00:10:14.660
Penne Arabiata.

00:10:14.740 --> 00:10:15.330
You.

00:10:15.330 --> 00:10:16.070
Yes?!

00:10:16.680 --> 00:10:18.270
You, young lady...

00:10:19.550 --> 00:10:20.740
I like you!

00:10:21.410 --> 00:10:23.440
Fritz, penne it is!

00:10:23.520 --> 00:10:25.070
Yes, sir.

00:10:25.150 --> 00:10:28.380
Folks, let me invite you for lunch.

00:10:29.820 --> 00:10:30.880
Lorna-san!

00:10:30.960 --> 00:10:33.250
Sounds good, let's go get some lunch.

00:10:33.560 --> 00:10:35.220
Then may I have some pasta as well?

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:36.020
No!

00:10:36.960 --> 00:10:39.690
What happened to my daughter?  Where is Angela?

00:10:39.900 --> 00:10:41.200
Huh?

00:10:41.270 --> 00:10:44.030
I believe she and Joe went to the spectators seats.

00:10:45.640 --> 00:10:46.830
I thought I told you...

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:51.810
I told you to have them wait here until I arrived.

00:10:51.880 --> 00:10:52.970
Uh...  Yes, sir.

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:54.480
Do I make myself clear?

00:10:54.550 --> 00:10:56.780
I am so sorry, I won't make the same mistake twice.

00:10:57.550 --> 00:10:58.810
Good.

00:10:58.880 --> 00:11:01.480
You make another mistake and you won't be in the drivers seat,

00:11:01.550 --> 00:11:03.020
you'll be riding in the trunk.

00:11:03.090 --> 00:11:04.990
Yes, sir...

00:11:09.900 --> 00:11:12.590
Is he really the president of a company?

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:15.330
That looked like something a mafia boss would do.

00:11:15.400 --> 00:11:17.370
Used to be, back in New York.

00:11:17.440 --> 00:11:18.400
Hey, wait!

00:11:23.040 --> 00:11:24.300
Come on, Angela...

00:11:27.450 --> 00:11:28.470
She's that...

00:11:28.550 --> 00:11:29.880
...girl from last night.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:30.810
Ahh!

00:11:31.380 --> 00:11:33.610
So we meet again, don't we?

00:11:34.120 --> 00:11:37.020
Angela, please show your gratitude.

00:11:37.090 --> 00:11:39.520
What's wrong?  They saved your life.

00:11:39.890 --> 00:11:42.520
I don't remember asking them to save me.

00:11:42.590 --> 00:11:43.360
What?!

00:11:43.860 --> 00:11:48.260
Everything got messed up because of you guys!

00:11:48.630 --> 00:11:50.000
Angela...

00:11:50.570 --> 00:11:52.500
Angela, Angela!

00:11:52.600 --> 00:11:55.440
Jeez, I just don't understand what's gotten into that girl recently.

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:57.870
What in the world is she thinking?

00:11:57.940 --> 00:12:00.310
She's probably at that rebellious stage.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:02.440
She's twelve years old after all.

00:12:02.980 --> 00:12:04.510
Twelve?!

00:12:04.580 --> 00:12:06.280
She's the same age as him!

00:12:06.350 --> 00:12:07.880
So what!?

00:12:07.950 --> 00:12:09.940
Well, you know...  It's like...

00:12:10.490 --> 00:12:11.850
Oh, come on, you know what I mean.

00:12:13.630 --> 00:12:15.460
So you agree?  She's off-limits, right?

00:12:15.530 --> 00:12:17.120
Well...  I guess.

00:12:26.240 --> 00:12:27.970
From the Japanese team, Lorna Endou!

00:12:28.510 --> 00:12:31.770
She's driving with such an intensity that its hard to believe this is just a test run.

00:12:32.840 --> 00:12:36.410
Viva Lorna!  Beautiful Lorna!

00:12:36.480 --> 00:12:37.850
Oh...  Great!

00:12:38.350 --> 00:12:40.480
Lorna-san!  This way, this way!

00:12:42.850 --> 00:12:44.690
Good job, Lorna-san.

00:12:46.460 --> 00:12:48.120
You're doing great.

00:12:48.190 --> 00:12:49.850
There's no doubt that you'll win this.

00:12:49.930 --> 00:12:50.950
Thanks.

00:12:51.030 --> 00:12:54.160
Oh...  What am I going to use the prize money for...

00:13:02.940 --> 00:13:04.270
It's her.

00:13:04.340 --> 00:13:05.870
She interests you, huh?

00:13:05.880 --> 00:13:06.380
Huh?

00:13:06.850 --> 00:13:08.140
The off-limits girl.

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:09.010
No way!

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.280
You've always been a sucker for big breasts.

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.110
Shut up!

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.510
The final race is finally coming up tomorrow.

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:19.990
And of course, I, Cayne Tokioka, will be here to give you a live broadcast of all the intensity!

00:13:20.060 --> 00:13:21.250
See you tomorrow!

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:30.760
Look!  Look!

00:13:31.940 --> 00:13:35.810
These clothes accent my charm perfectly!

00:13:35.870 --> 00:13:37.240
They sure do.

00:13:42.210 --> 00:13:43.880
Hey!  You ready yet?

00:13:42.520 --> 00:13:43.880
This pose, for example...

00:13:44.750 --> 00:13:46.840
Oh, this is good, isn't it?

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:47.050
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:13:47.120 --> 00:13:48.590
Alright!

00:13:48.820 --> 00:13:51.880
I'm going to get the best guy out there with my charms.

00:13:51.960 --> 00:13:55.920
Yes!  Tonight, the main attraction will be me!

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:02.430
Eh?  This is...

00:14:03.170 --> 00:14:05.430
At this rate Lorna is going to be the main attraction!

00:14:06.140 --> 00:14:08.470
What gives?  How come?  Why?

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:11.570
Why aren't the guys gathering around me?

00:14:11.640 --> 00:14:13.740
It's because of that outfit.

00:14:14.050 --> 00:14:15.240
You think so?

00:14:15.780 --> 00:14:20.380
Your eyes look like they're hunting prey.  That's scaring everyone off.

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:29.030
(Note: Shichi-go-san is a Japanese holiday for boys)

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:24.110
To hear that from you!  You're dressed up yourself as if it was shichi-go-san.

00:14:24.660 --> 00:14:29.030
Well then don't worry about it.  Just 'cause he's wearing a necktie doesn't mean a man has some obligation to approach a girl.

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:34.160
If that's how it is, then I'll just eat, eat, EAT!

00:14:35.600 --> 00:14:40.300
...and then Robert, my cousin second removed says: "You're not suited for a cop"

00:14:40.840 --> 00:14:42.470
I'm saved.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:43.600
No way in hell!

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:45.580
But if we split up,

00:14:45.640 --> 00:14:49.140
what will happen to our teamwork as eX-Drivers?

00:14:49.210 --> 00:14:50.440
That has nothing to do with it.

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:53.440
Those two don't have it easy either, huh?

00:14:53.750 --> 00:14:55.080
Bring me back another helping!

00:14:55.150 --> 00:14:56.180
Why me?!

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:57.780
I dare you to say that again!

00:14:58.160 --> 00:14:59.990
You don't get it yet?

00:15:00.060 --> 00:15:05.690
Tomorrow's race will be won by the Chinese team, that I, Somin Wang, am sponsoring.

00:15:06.600 --> 00:15:08.830
You sure talk big,

00:15:08.900 --> 00:15:11.960
but you don't seem to know the strengths of our American team.

00:15:13.070 --> 00:15:14.830
A hopeless cause, I guess.

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:18.070
It's sad to hear some overcooked-pasta guy whine like that.

00:15:18.380 --> 00:15:20.000
Fritz...

00:15:20.210 --> 00:15:21.910
Yes, sir.

00:15:22.580 --> 00:15:23.880
What the hell is that?

00:15:23.950 --> 00:15:26.040
It's a gift from your uncle in New York.

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:29.180
Put it away, put it away.  Something as shady-looking as that.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:32.150
If you insist.  That's too bad...

00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:34.920
In the old days you often scared the punks with this and...

00:15:34.990 --> 00:15:38.160
What I want is something to drink - I want some wine!

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:39.700
Billy, go get some.

00:15:41.100 --> 00:15:45.560
You're like barbarians who can't get rid of their Mafia habits...

00:15:45.640 --> 00:15:49.300
You're blabbering is getting annoying, Peking Duck!

00:15:52.780 --> 00:15:55.250
Don't speak like that to me.

00:15:55.310 --> 00:15:56.710
I cook bastards like you for dinner!

00:15:58.550 --> 00:16:01.180
Peking Duck, Peking Duck...

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:02.720
Peking Duck, Peking Duck...

00:16:05.690 --> 00:16:07.560
The overcooked-pasta guy has nasty character traits as well, huh?

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:10.090
What did you say, you bastard?

00:16:11.860 --> 00:16:12.920
Sir...

00:16:14.970 --> 00:16:16.960
Angela is missing?

00:16:20.710 --> 00:16:21.930
You idiot!

00:16:22.010 --> 00:16:24.310
I told you so many times to keep your eyes on her.

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:26.440
Stop slipping up.

00:16:27.310 --> 00:16:28.940
I'm terribly sorry, sir.

00:16:29.010 --> 00:16:29.670
I will go find her immediately.

00:16:30.050 --> 00:16:31.020
Fritz...

00:16:31.080 --> 00:16:32.980
Help Joe.

00:16:33.720 --> 00:16:34.650
Joe...

00:16:34.720 --> 00:16:37.660
Take me to the place where you last saw the young lady.

00:16:38.790 --> 00:16:40.690
I'm sorry, Billy.

00:16:41.230 --> 00:16:43.250
I wonder what's happened now.

00:16:43.330 --> 00:16:44.820
How should I know?

00:16:45.260 --> 00:16:46.820
It seems that Angela is missing.

00:16:48.330 --> 00:16:51.170
Disappearing all of a sudden, riding in rampaging AI cars...

00:16:52.200 --> 00:16:54.830
She really is a high-maintenance girl.

00:16:54.910 --> 00:16:56.400
That's not all, though...

00:16:57.510 --> 00:17:00.440
I forgot to mention this but that rampaging AI car had some illegal ROM installed on it.

00:17:01.550 --> 00:17:03.210
It wasn't because of a bug.

00:17:03.280 --> 00:17:05.840
It was programmed to run rampant.

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.240
So it was a planned rampage.

00:17:08.750 --> 00:17:11.310
Why in the world would anyone do such a thing?

00:17:12.090 --> 00:17:13.650
I don't know.

00:17:13.830 --> 00:17:15.660
But, in any case...

00:17:15.730 --> 00:17:19.790
...her disappearances and the rampaging may be connected.

00:17:19.870 --> 00:17:22.830
That means she could be being targeted by someone.

00:17:23.870 --> 00:17:26.200
Anyway, we should go look for her as well.

00:17:30.380 --> 00:17:31.340
Have you seen her?

00:17:31.410 --> 00:17:32.880
No.

00:17:33.180 --> 00:17:34.080
What about on your side, Lorna?

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:36.110
She's not over here either.

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:38.450
So that means she's outside the hotel.

00:17:41.190 --> 00:17:43.650
I'm going to search the circuit.

00:17:43.990 --> 00:17:45.550
Let's check out the parking area.

00:17:45.620 --> 00:17:46.350
Let's go, Lorna!

00:17:46.430 --> 00:17:47.220
Yeah!

00:18:10.650 --> 00:18:12.950
Why is there a cleaning car here at this hour?

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:19.520
That's...

00:18:52.420 --> 00:18:53.360
Shit!

00:18:53.430 --> 00:18:55.860
Michael!  Go call for the fire department!

00:18:55.930 --> 00:18:57.330
Y-Yes, sir!

00:18:57.400 --> 00:18:59.190
I saw a suspicious-looking shadow.

00:18:59.260 --> 00:18:59.990
Can you chase 'em?

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:01.190
I'll try.

00:19:01.670 --> 00:19:05.360
Fire department?!  Fire department?!  This is the Circuit Course.

00:19:05.440 --> 00:19:07.600
Boom!  There was a huge explosion!

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:09.870
Even my sister's husband was surprised!

00:19:13.950 --> 00:19:15.140
Wait!

00:19:18.520 --> 00:19:19.850
Stop!

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:26.880
Your face...  Show it to me!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:29.090
Angela?

00:19:31.000 --> 00:19:32.760
O-Ouch...

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.960
Don't use my name so casually.

00:19:36.030 --> 00:19:38.060
How can you recognize a girl by her breasts alone?

00:19:38.300 --> 00:19:40.070
Ah...  I'm sorry.

00:19:40.240 --> 00:19:43.030
More importantly, what were you thinking?!

00:19:43.380 --> 00:19:45.040
The circuit is destroyed.

00:19:45.110 --> 00:19:47.410
Tomorrow's championship race will be cancelled.

00:19:47.710 --> 00:19:49.200
Not bad for a day's work.

00:19:49.650 --> 00:19:50.580
You've gotta be joking!

00:19:51.020 --> 00:19:55.010
Do you have an idea how many people are inconvenienced by you?

00:19:57.820 --> 00:20:00.260
Wait up!  Hey!

00:20:00.490 --> 00:20:02.590
Leave me alone!

00:20:04.360 --> 00:20:05.690
Who are you?

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:07.360
Angela!

00:20:14.110 --> 00:20:16.540
Hey!  What are you doing?!

00:20:16.610 --> 00:20:18.740
Stop it!  Let me go!

00:20:45.400 --> 00:20:46.930
Are you awake?

00:20:50.640 --> 00:20:54.440
Honestly, everytime you're involved, nothing good happens.

00:20:59.750 --> 00:21:01.520
You're one to talk.

00:21:01.650 --> 00:21:04.920
Everytime you show up nothing goes right for me either.

00:21:07.190 --> 00:21:08.450
Now then...

00:21:08.760 --> 00:21:10.460
There's a reason for this, right?

00:21:11.060 --> 00:21:13.730
They couldn't be going after you, now could they?

00:21:15.130 --> 00:21:18.100
Well, I won't force you to talk, but its not good to worry over it by yourself.

00:21:18.370 --> 00:21:20.590
I guess we'll just suffer alone.  Oh well.

00:21:22.310 --> 00:21:23.610
Wang Soming...

00:21:26.780 --> 00:21:27.770
Wang Soming...

00:21:28.280 --> 00:21:32.010
He runs a supermarket chain on the west coast.

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:36.620
He's also the sponsor of the Chinese eX-Driver team.

00:21:37.290 --> 00:21:40.020
So he's your old man's rival, then?

00:21:40.460 --> 00:21:44.790
And now he's taken that rival's daughter hostage.

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:51.660
Is that information reliable?

00:21:52.300 --> 00:21:56.100
A suspicious AI car was seen driving away from the circuit?

00:21:56.410 --> 00:21:57.310
Yeah.

00:21:57.380 --> 00:22:00.370
Someone that looks like Souichi-kun was seen in the car as well.

00:22:00.450 --> 00:22:01.710
Who saw all this?

00:22:02.510 --> 00:22:05.680
Oh, don't worry.  I'm sure it's a good guy.

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:09.620
Sorry, I don't care about that anymore.

00:22:11.160 --> 00:22:14.280
Alright, we're going to blast through all the way to San Pedro.

00:22:28.440 --> 00:22:30.410
I thought I was gonna die!

00:22:30.480 --> 00:22:32.270
Get ahold of yourself.

00:22:33.140 --> 00:22:34.610
I'll be careful.

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:46.350
My dad gives the American eX-Driver team a tremendous amount of money.

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:55.590
That's because for a group like the eX-Drivers to work, we need the support of the public and buisness sectors.

00:22:56.800 --> 00:23:03.170
In return for this my dad has gotten access to the world-wide eX-Driver host computer.

00:23:03.240 --> 00:23:06.210
A special service for an important sponsor?

00:23:06.280 --> 00:23:08.800
That in itself isn't bad...

00:23:08.880 --> 00:23:09.440
But...

00:23:09.520 --> 00:23:10.140
Yeah?

00:23:11.520 --> 00:23:13.920
I've seen it.

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:23.120
One time,

00:23:23.200 --> 00:23:26.890
I had just wanted to surprise my dad with a secret birthday present, but...

00:23:29.270 --> 00:23:31.500
At first I didn't know what it was,

00:23:32.570 --> 00:23:35.300
but then it dawned on me...

00:23:36.240 --> 00:23:40.410
It was an odds list based on eX-Driver data.

00:23:44.320 --> 00:23:45.580
Then that means...

00:23:45.880 --> 00:23:48.050
Yes, they're gambling.

00:23:50.590 --> 00:23:56.330
Dad has partnered up with Wang and other sponsors and is trying to bet on the final race.

00:23:56.400 --> 00:24:00.800
Using eX-Driver activities as a gambling venue is outlawed throughout the world

00:24:01.270 --> 00:24:03.390
A violation of that magnitude warrants severe punishment.

00:24:03.470 --> 00:24:05.100
Oh, I see...

00:24:05.170 --> 00:24:07.710
In order to stop your father from participating in the bet,

00:24:07.710 --> 00:24:11.200
you caused the rampage on purpose, in an attempt to injure yourself.

00:24:11.510 --> 00:24:14.210
But, we showed up and interfered with that plan.

00:24:14.550 --> 00:24:17.410
That's why you used the AI cleaning car after that.

00:24:17.880 --> 00:24:18.940
Yes.

00:24:19.320 --> 00:24:23.610
But, why dont you just say it straight out, "Stop gambling."

00:24:24.960 --> 00:24:27.160
Wang is involved in this plan,

00:24:27.860 --> 00:24:30.370
there's no way he'd listen to me.

00:24:31.000 --> 00:24:31.830
You think it's going to work?

00:24:31.900 --> 00:24:32.810
Leave it to me.

00:24:36.240 --> 00:24:37.290
Here, let me take a look.

00:24:39.970 --> 00:24:40.770
Thank you.

00:24:41.810 --> 00:24:45.060
And so they took you hostage in order to threaten your father.

00:24:50.330 --> 00:24:51.500
Where are they?

00:24:58.090 --> 00:24:59.150
You bastard!

00:25:04.110 --> 00:25:04.840
Show me your hands.

00:25:08.450 --> 00:25:09.060
Hey!

00:25:09.550 --> 00:25:11.180
Even though the circuit has been destroyed,

00:25:11.590 --> 00:25:13.330
the race will definitely be held.

00:25:14.690 --> 00:25:15.730
I'm going to help you too.

00:25:16.430 --> 00:25:18.360
Let's convince your father together.

00:25:19.460 --> 00:25:20.370
The name's Souichi,

00:25:22.460 --> 00:25:23.620
Souichi Sugano.

00:25:32.210 --> 00:25:33.000
What?!

00:25:33.580 --> 00:25:35.720
What the... How did you get out!?

00:25:38.710 --> 00:25:40.580
After them!  Don't let them get away!

00:25:54.500 --> 00:25:55.220
The outside.

00:25:59.540 --> 00:26:00.930
I'll climb up and check it out.

00:26:01.000 --> 00:26:01.660
Wait.

00:26:13.350 --> 00:26:14.010
Did you find them?

00:26:14.080 --> 00:26:14.560
No, sir.

00:26:15.020 --> 00:26:17.340
Damn them, where are they hiding?

00:26:17.990 --> 00:26:18.510
What?

00:26:26.400 --> 00:26:29.020
My...  My Alfa!!

00:26:29.470 --> 00:26:31.430
PEKING DUCK!

00:26:35.770 --> 00:26:37.900
Don't let them get away!  Shut the gate!

00:26:37.970 --> 00:26:38.450
Yes, sir!

00:26:46.450 --> 00:26:47.520
The gate is closing!

00:26:47.950 --> 00:26:50.350
Hold on tight, we're going to break through.

00:26:55.020 --> 00:26:57.990
Please stop, you're going to get my Alfa scratched!

00:27:01.430 --> 00:27:02.620
The engine stalled?

00:27:02.700 --> 00:27:03.600
It's broken?

00:27:03.670 --> 00:27:05.570
If it's important to you at least keep it maintained!

00:27:07.900 --> 00:27:09.500
Open the gate!!

00:27:09.570 --> 00:27:11.400
Don't damage my precious Alfa any more.

00:27:11.470 --> 00:27:13.370
But then they will...

00:27:13.440 --> 00:27:15.210
Oh, that's right.

00:27:15.280 --> 00:27:16.270
Close the gate!

00:27:21.020 --> 00:27:21.910
It started again!

00:27:21.980 --> 00:27:23.140
Souichi, quickly!

00:27:23.420 --> 00:27:25.580
Sorry, Alfa, please don't take it personally.

00:27:26.320 --> 00:27:27.580
Stop!

00:27:27.660 --> 00:27:29.420
Don't move any further.

00:27:32.930 --> 00:27:35.160
I'll let you get away but please stop!

00:27:40.540 --> 00:27:41.730
Yahoo!

00:27:41.800 --> 00:27:42.710
You did it!

00:27:52.510 --> 00:27:56.680
Oh my... my Alfa...my Alfa!

00:27:58.520 --> 00:27:59.820
Oh...  Boss!

00:27:59.890 --> 00:28:01.050
Let's get him to the first-aid room!

00:28:01.760 --> 00:28:04.120
Get some soup, fried rice, no, sweet-and-sour pork!

00:28:08.030 --> 00:28:08.790
Lorna-san!

00:28:12.630 --> 00:28:13.830
Souichi?

00:28:22.780 --> 00:28:24.910
Look at that, he's totally fine.

00:28:25.610 --> 00:28:26.880
We were worried over nothing!

00:28:43.130 --> 00:28:44.290
I see...

00:28:44.360 --> 00:28:46.410
He's using the final race for gambling.

00:28:47.100 --> 00:28:50.190
Man!  Aren't they already making enough?

00:28:50.270 --> 00:28:52.600
The championship race has been postponed until tomorrow afternoon.

00:28:53.040 --> 00:28:55.280
They say that the course will be ready by then too.

00:28:56.410 --> 00:28:58.210
Let's persuade Angela's father.

00:29:00.750 --> 00:29:02.230
We'll make him stop gambling.

00:29:15.360 --> 00:29:17.000
I'm disappointed in you.

00:29:18.260 --> 00:29:20.460
To think that you couldn't even protect Angela.

00:29:20.630 --> 00:29:22.040
Please forgive me.

00:29:23.800 --> 00:29:26.600
I had even thought about making you president...

00:29:27.040 --> 00:29:29.040
...and let you carry on my business.

00:29:30.080 --> 00:29:30.870
But...

00:29:32.010 --> 00:29:33.590
You're scum.

00:29:34.080 --> 00:29:37.880
You failed to get your license and couldn't become an eX-Driver.

00:29:38.320 --> 00:29:41.620
I can't hand my company to some loser like you.

00:29:42.390 --> 00:29:43.430
Show me some results.

00:29:43.690 --> 00:29:47.090
Just because you're family, does not mean I'll cut you any slack.

00:29:47.160 --> 00:29:48.160
Y-Yes, sir.

00:29:51.460 --> 00:29:55.160
At tomorrow's final race, I'm making a big transaction.

00:29:55.730 --> 00:29:57.990
I'm giving you one last chance.

00:29:59.010 --> 00:30:00.080
Yes, sir.

00:30:04.910 --> 00:30:05.880
Pasta is great.

00:30:06.510 --> 00:30:08.460
It's the best food in the world.

00:30:09.450 --> 00:30:10.310
Isn't that right?

00:30:11.150 --> 00:30:13.740
I hope you will do your best during the final race.

00:30:14.220 --> 00:30:17.970
Of course, try to hold back a little so you don't scare the American team too badly.

00:30:19.160 --> 00:30:20.150
Now then,

00:30:20.660 --> 00:30:23.380
I think it's about time that I thank you guys.

00:30:24.530 --> 00:30:26.160
Not only once, but twice,

00:30:26.500 --> 00:30:29.800
you've saved my daughter.

00:30:29.870 --> 00:30:30.890
How much do you want?

00:30:31.640 --> 00:30:33.660
No need to be modest.  Now...

00:30:33.740 --> 00:30:34.500
We can't accept that.

00:30:35.410 --> 00:30:38.100
We didn't save Angela to get your money.

00:30:38.340 --> 00:30:41.260
That's right.  I would never want your money.

00:30:42.310 --> 00:30:42.870
What did you say?

00:30:43.280 --> 00:30:46.260
You guys are going to bet on the final race, right?

00:30:46.550 --> 00:30:47.770
We're on to you!

00:30:48.950 --> 00:30:50.920
So you're saying we're gambling?

00:30:52.320 --> 00:30:54.080
That's a pretty funny story.

00:30:55.060 --> 00:30:57.360
You brats, quit your silly stories.

00:30:57.930 --> 00:31:00.500
Then why did Angela get kidnapped?!

00:31:01.700 --> 00:31:03.140
I've seen it.

00:31:04.300 --> 00:31:06.860
I've seen the data you've assembled in order to gamble.

00:31:09.370 --> 00:31:10.370
Angela.

00:31:11.040 --> 00:31:13.810
I'm not a father that would disappoint his children.

00:31:18.980 --> 00:31:19.980
Sit down.

00:31:20.690 --> 00:31:22.120
Angela...  Wait!

00:31:23.120 --> 00:31:26.490
Please, don't make Angela sad.

00:31:27.190 --> 00:31:31.320
I wanted to enjoy our pasta dishes with you, but...

00:31:34.600 --> 00:31:35.790
What a pity,

00:31:39.770 --> 00:31:41.500
Damn it, this is pissing me off!

00:31:47.580 --> 00:31:48.570
Joe...

00:31:49.450 --> 00:31:53.320
Didn't Mom tell you to quit that habit?

00:31:54.020 --> 00:31:56.680
It looks like you're causing Father some trouble.

00:31:57.250 --> 00:31:58.350
That's because Dad's...

00:31:59.090 --> 00:32:02.520
I'm sure you've noticed it as well, I mean, you're always by Dad's side so...

00:32:02.590 --> 00:32:04.260
It's best to keep quiet.

00:32:04.760 --> 00:32:05.480
But...

00:32:08.100 --> 00:32:09.240
I'm worried...

00:32:10.250 --> 00:32:11.240
...about you.

00:32:14.210 --> 00:32:17.110
Do you really dislike your father?

00:32:17.180 --> 00:32:18.300
Well...

00:32:19.280 --> 00:32:22.700
Its true that since Mother died Dad has gotten a bit rougher.

00:32:23.620 --> 00:32:26.220
But it might be that he's lonely.

00:32:28.290 --> 00:32:30.360
Please don't start to hate your father.

00:32:31.090 --> 00:32:33.750
I owe him very much.

00:32:34.060 --> 00:32:35.060
Joe...

00:32:35.630 --> 00:32:38.380
You'd been thinking about Father that much...

00:32:39.800 --> 00:32:41.960
I guess you're all on Dad's side after all...

00:32:42.800 --> 00:32:45.040
...and I am all alone.

00:32:45.500 --> 00:32:46.600
That's not true.

00:32:47.510 --> 00:32:48.990
Your father is very important to me.

00:32:49.580 --> 00:32:53.190
But Angela, I'll always be on your side.

00:32:53.710 --> 00:32:54.610
Come hell or high water.

00:32:55.750 --> 00:32:56.750
Joe...

00:32:57.220 --> 00:33:02.120
I've always thought of you as an older brother.

00:33:08.890 --> 00:33:09.720
But...

00:33:16.400 --> 00:33:17.610
The preparations are done.

00:33:18.170 --> 00:33:19.000
Okay.

00:33:35.050 --> 00:33:36.750
Welcome!  Welcome~!

00:33:37.390 --> 00:33:40.120
The long awaited eX-Driver final race is finally starting.

00:33:40.560 --> 00:33:43.150
Let's get this show on the road!

00:33:50.670 --> 00:33:55.000
The world's fastest eX-Driver will finally be determined in this race.

00:33:55.370 --> 00:33:58.060
Who will be the winner?

00:34:00.850 --> 00:34:03.820
I'll never lose to that Peking Duck guy.

00:34:04.320 --> 00:34:05.330
Joe...

00:34:11.020 --> 00:34:12.990
The deadline for the bets is right before the start.

00:34:13.490 --> 00:34:16.660
The place where they will exchange funds will be decided a little before that.

00:34:17.060 --> 00:34:20.220
We'll have to pay attention to their moves.

00:34:20.930 --> 00:34:22.670
I'm sorry that I can't help out.

00:34:23.200 --> 00:34:26.230
Don't worry about that, just concentrate on the race.

00:34:26.310 --> 00:34:28.430
That's right, do your best.

00:34:28.510 --> 00:34:29.130
'kay.

00:34:33.910 --> 00:34:34.710
Boss!

00:34:35.810 --> 00:34:38.560
The instructions arrived.  It's at depot number four.

00:34:40.920 --> 00:34:41.480
Joe...

00:34:42.050 --> 00:34:42.710
Yes, sir!

00:34:43.220 --> 00:34:44.250
Are you going to be alright?

00:34:44.320 --> 00:34:45.540
No worries.

00:34:49.060 --> 00:34:50.820
At last, the final race is going to start!

00:34:51.630 --> 00:34:54.200
The contestants are entering the battlefield.

00:35:05.240 --> 00:35:08.240
Thank you, thank you.  Woohoo!

00:35:10.920 --> 00:35:11.480
Yes?

00:35:13.690 --> 00:35:15.040
Okay, understood.

00:35:15.590 --> 00:35:17.610
That was Angela, it's at depot number four.

00:35:17.690 --> 00:35:18.380
Let's go.

00:35:18.460 --> 00:35:19.220
Okay!

00:35:29.700 --> 00:35:30.560
Excuse me!

00:35:37.360 --> 00:35:38.310
There they are.

00:35:39.040 --> 00:35:39.880
Let's go after them.

00:35:43.780 --> 00:35:44.780
Detective Ralph.

00:35:45.220 --> 00:35:47.060
Ah, you did it again.

00:35:47.420 --> 00:35:49.060
You two, don't wander around.

00:35:49.560 --> 00:35:52.270
Listen, they're committing a crime down there.

00:35:53.860 --> 00:35:55.290
How do you know that?

00:35:55.630 --> 00:35:56.790
What did you say?

00:35:56.860 --> 00:35:58.760
Don't tell me that you're in on this!

00:36:10.130 --> 00:36:12.040
Then, let's begin.

00:36:14.050 --> 00:36:15.480
The American team.

00:36:16.580 --> 00:36:17.830
The Chinese team.

00:36:18.850 --> 00:36:21.220
The Russian team for me.

00:36:22.220 --> 00:36:23.530
This much on the British team.

00:36:24.290 --> 00:36:25.620
All on the Italian team.

00:36:26.630 --> 00:36:28.060
I bet everything on the French team.

00:36:28.590 --> 00:36:29.780
It's finally going to start.

00:36:30.330 --> 00:36:30.860
Yeah.

00:36:38.700 --> 00:36:39.730
Sit down.

00:36:42.140 --> 00:36:42.900
Young lady!

00:36:43.510 --> 00:36:44.860
I'm going to sue him,

00:36:45.110 --> 00:36:47.740
I'm definitely going to sue him for sexual harrassment!

00:36:48.080 --> 00:36:49.950
Damn you, let go of me!

00:36:50.020 --> 00:36:52.640
Let go, you...

00:36:52.990 --> 00:36:55.950
Please listen, there are things that we have to do!

00:36:56.220 --> 00:36:58.110
I hate America!

00:36:58.700 --> 00:37:00.650
I'm never eating hot dogs again!

00:37:01.060 --> 00:37:04.120
I swear on that!

00:37:27.450 --> 00:37:29.420
The race is about to commence!

00:37:31.890 --> 00:37:33.240
Stop!

00:37:34.230 --> 00:37:35.060
Joe!

00:37:35.190 --> 00:37:35.880
Angela!

00:37:36.560 --> 00:37:37.290
Souichi...

00:37:37.360 --> 00:37:38.350
Let go!

00:37:38.500 --> 00:37:40.380
You...  How did you guys get away?

00:37:40.390 --> 00:37:42.360
We don't have time for this!

00:37:42.960 --> 00:37:45.210
Make them stop before the race starts!

00:37:45.400 --> 00:37:46.840
Joe!  Joe!

00:37:46.910 --> 00:37:50.200
Don't make Dad a criminal, Joe!

00:37:50.940 --> 00:37:52.040
Start...

00:37:52.110 --> 00:37:53.230
Start!

00:37:56.880 --> 00:38:00.600
The eX-Driver championship race has finally begun!

00:38:03.590 --> 00:38:06.290
When the battle between the eX-Drivers has chosen the champion,

00:38:06.860 --> 00:38:10.450
the winner in our circle will be chosen as well.

00:38:10.800 --> 00:38:11.850
I don't know about that.

00:38:13.330 --> 00:38:15.290
The one that's going to win is me.

00:38:15.530 --> 00:38:16.690
You bastard!

00:38:20.640 --> 00:38:23.070
Joe!  That's right, Joe.  You have to make them stop this gamble.

00:38:23.740 --> 00:38:24.670
You guys...

00:38:24.810 --> 00:38:28.060
Wang, this is the end of your scheming.

00:38:30.280 --> 00:38:32.710
Behave yourself, Angela.

00:38:33.550 --> 00:38:35.110
Bring me all the money!

00:38:35.490 --> 00:38:38.010
If you resist, I don't know what might happen to this young lady.

00:38:39.120 --> 00:38:40.140
Joe...

00:38:40.140 --> 00:38:41.160
Why?...

00:38:41.460 --> 00:38:44.360
Let go of her, she's your sister!

00:38:44.760 --> 00:38:45.710
No, she isn't.

00:38:45.860 --> 00:38:48.640
I don't have a sister.  This is Rico's daughter!

00:38:51.140 --> 00:38:53.900
Joe!  Let go of Angela!

00:38:54.170 --> 00:38:55.240
Like I would!

00:38:55.670 --> 00:38:57.910
If I let go of her you'll kill me!

00:38:58.340 --> 00:39:00.430
You've always been planning on killing me!

00:39:02.210 --> 00:39:05.250
I'm going to emancipate myself from this violent old man!

00:39:05.780 --> 00:39:07.510
Consider this payback.

00:39:07.590 --> 00:39:10.970
I appreciate that you have amassed this ridiculous amount of money with your gamble.

00:39:11.860 --> 00:39:12.520
Don't move!

00:39:12.590 --> 00:39:13.590
Gamble?

00:39:15.630 --> 00:39:18.550
Did you think that we were gambling?

00:39:20.130 --> 00:39:23.400
This is the money that we, the sponsors,

00:39:23.600 --> 00:39:25.690
are donating to the eX-Drivers.

00:39:26.640 --> 00:39:30.780
Lately, there's been a nasty movement targeting our money.

00:39:31.840 --> 00:39:36.210
So, in order to capture the culprit, Rico and I enacted this whole thing.

00:39:37.080 --> 00:39:38.190
What did you say?!

00:39:38.780 --> 00:39:39.580
Dad...

00:39:40.320 --> 00:39:43.140
Of course, everything had been discussed with the police.

00:39:43.540 --> 00:39:46.950
And you're the one that walked right into that trap.

00:39:47.330 --> 00:39:49.450
T-That can't be!

00:39:50.260 --> 00:39:51.160
Dad...

00:39:51.560 --> 00:39:53.520
Please don't do anything rash.

00:39:54.730 --> 00:39:56.120
Why, Joe?

00:39:57.100 --> 00:39:58.660
Why are you doing this?

00:39:59.120 --> 00:40:00.720
You should ask your conscience that question.

00:40:01.440 --> 00:40:06.840
You took me in as a child and have abused me for more than ten years!

00:40:07.180 --> 00:40:09.180
I'm not your dog!

00:40:09.550 --> 00:40:10.190
No.

00:40:10.680 --> 00:40:13.170
I think of you as my real son.

00:40:13.820 --> 00:40:16.820
Because you're my son I treated you harder than the others.

00:40:16.860 --> 00:40:17.830
Shut up!

00:40:18.390 --> 00:40:19.080
Boss!

00:40:19.960 --> 00:40:20.580
Joe!

00:40:20.760 --> 00:40:21.730
Dad!

00:40:39.210 --> 00:40:40.350
Put the money in.

00:40:40.750 --> 00:40:41.540
Hurry up!

00:40:42.410 --> 00:40:43.480
Not so fast!

00:40:43.860 --> 00:40:44.530
Wait,

00:40:45.290 --> 00:40:45.920
I beg you.

00:40:46.490 --> 00:40:47.950
Please do as he says.

00:40:48.770 --> 00:40:50.570
I know that you won't understand, but...

00:40:51.860 --> 00:40:52.850
Please try to.

00:40:59.700 --> 00:41:02.360
I've finally managed to get him on his knees!

00:41:02.430 --> 00:41:03.700
I win!

00:41:05.270 --> 00:41:06.040
Dad...

00:41:07.640 --> 00:41:10.460
Hey, hurry up and bring the money to the carrier!

00:41:11.980 --> 00:41:13.480
There's not much choice.

00:41:14.150 --> 00:41:16.600
Gentlemen, let's do as he says.

00:41:17.050 --> 00:41:19.480
I don't want any more people to get hurt.

00:41:21.750 --> 00:41:23.670
Is this really okay?

00:41:23.990 --> 00:41:25.620
Well, I don't really know...

00:41:25.690 --> 00:41:28.300
I haven't learned anything about this kind of situation, not even from my great-grandfather.

00:41:29.460 --> 00:41:30.670
I've got to do something.

00:41:31.550 --> 00:41:32.460
Something...

00:41:37.240 --> 00:41:38.670
I don't care if it's a trap,

00:41:39.100 --> 00:41:40.770
I'm going to take this money.

00:41:41.370 --> 00:41:42.910
Don't take it personally.

00:41:44.040 --> 00:41:45.770
Dad!

00:41:46.550 --> 00:41:47.260
Angela!

00:42:02.010 --> 00:42:02.680
We have to pursue them.

00:42:02.850 --> 00:42:03.490
Okay.

00:42:04.520 --> 00:42:05.990
H-Hey!  Wait up!

00:42:06.650 --> 00:42:07.540
We're going too.

00:42:07.580 --> 00:42:08.680
Y-Y-Yes, sir!

00:42:13.060 --> 00:42:13.940
Boss!

00:42:15.760 --> 00:42:16.620
Madeline...

00:42:20.440 --> 00:42:21.630
I'm sorry...

00:42:22.370 --> 00:42:23.070
Madeline.

00:43:14.520 --> 00:43:15.740
Why is Angela in there?

00:43:17.220 --> 00:43:19.240
Oh my!  What's this?!

00:43:19.790 --> 00:43:21.850
A rampant car has broken onto the course!

00:43:21.920 --> 00:43:24.970
Oh no!  Unbelievable!

00:43:38.040 --> 00:43:39.200
Oh no...

00:43:49.180 --> 00:43:51.350
Why is a carrier on the course?

00:43:53.760 --> 00:43:54.460
Kelly-san!

00:44:09.370 --> 00:44:10.460
This is unbelievable.

00:44:10.460 --> 00:44:14.630
The eX-Driver world tournament stadium has been transformed...

00:44:14.680 --> 00:44:17.660
...to ruin by a rampant vehicle in an instant!

00:44:29.320 --> 00:44:31.320
Lorna-san!  Lorna-san!

00:44:32.260 --> 00:44:34.130
Ah...  Souichi-kun?

00:44:37.770 --> 00:44:39.600
Lorna-san, are you okay?

00:44:40.170 --> 00:44:40.950
Yeah.

00:44:41.330 --> 00:44:42.460
I knew it.

00:44:42.990 --> 00:44:44.980
A rampaging carrier couldn't get you.

00:44:45.670 --> 00:44:47.530
The real bad guy is Joe.

00:44:48.180 --> 00:44:50.740
He's trying to get away with the AI carrier.

00:44:50.980 --> 00:44:53.230
Lorna, it's time for us to move out!

00:44:53.850 --> 00:44:54.460
Understood!

00:45:04.530 --> 00:45:07.000
I'm not going to sit by and watch them beat me again.

00:45:07.780 --> 00:45:09.390
David, come in.

00:45:10.500 --> 00:45:12.520
Everything's spinning, Kelly.

00:45:12.630 --> 00:45:14.530
No time for fooling around.

00:45:14.800 --> 00:45:15.920
We're going to chase after the rampant carrier.

00:45:16.410 --> 00:45:17.030
That's right!

00:45:17.480 --> 00:45:19.870
We have to stop it before the little guys from Japan do.

00:45:20.640 --> 00:45:21.770
Okay, Kelly.

00:45:22.610 --> 00:45:25.940
I'll show them the soul of American eX-Driver.

00:45:32.790 --> 00:45:34.690
Please, take me with you as well.

00:45:35.590 --> 00:45:38.280
Don't worry, we'll get Angela back.

00:45:38.780 --> 00:45:41.200
We're the best alternates in the world.

00:45:41.730 --> 00:45:42.560
Trust us.

00:45:44.730 --> 00:45:45.560
Officer Ralph.

00:45:45.770 --> 00:45:48.040
The pursuit of criminals is my job.

00:45:48.450 --> 00:45:49.050
Go!

00:45:49.290 --> 00:45:49.850
Okay!

00:45:54.530 --> 00:45:56.860
Officer Ralph, wait for me!

00:45:57.660 --> 00:45:59.470
What am I going to do?

00:45:59.930 --> 00:46:00.630
I know,

00:46:00.780 --> 00:46:03.470
at times like this is when the 15 generation Calahan teaching comes to the forefront.

00:46:03.770 --> 00:46:06.120
"In catching a criminal, the ends justify the means," comes into play!

00:46:06.440 --> 00:46:07.660
Alright, I'm going to do it!

00:46:29.600 --> 00:46:30.530
What the hell was that?

00:46:36.640 --> 00:46:37.970
Joe...why?

00:46:38.900 --> 00:46:42.360
I believed in you.  I believed in you all the time.

00:46:42.510 --> 00:46:43.990
That's probably true.

00:46:44.540 --> 00:46:47.880
I mean I've been acting accordingly, in order to get you to trust me.

00:46:48.300 --> 00:46:50.910
Jeeze, what a naive little girl you are.

00:47:05.930 --> 00:47:06.660
Here they come.

00:47:12.740 --> 00:47:14.530
He's trying to keep us from getting the front sensors.

00:47:14.970 --> 00:47:17.070
The streets are too narrow in this city!

00:47:17.480 --> 00:47:21.480
There is a street on this route where there is regular AI car traffic.

00:47:22.150 --> 00:47:23.120
What did you say?

00:47:23.380 --> 00:47:25.250
It's a security hole in the control program.

00:47:25.480 --> 00:47:28.350
Ahead is Route 5, which leads into the desert.

00:47:28.620 --> 00:47:31.060
If we can transfer it onto there we could get it out of the city, but...

00:47:33.230 --> 00:47:34.670
Leave it to us.

00:47:34.960 --> 00:47:38.330
Americans will take care of cleaning up America.

00:47:44.470 --> 00:47:46.310
Leave the AI cars to us.

00:47:46.570 --> 00:47:47.800
We'll stop them.

00:47:56.550 --> 00:47:58.720
A rampant car is closing in!

00:47:59.420 --> 00:48:00.680
Please run away immediately!

00:48:01.850 --> 00:48:02.510
Hurry!

00:48:03.460 --> 00:48:04.900
We're closing this street!

00:48:05.560 --> 00:48:06.420
There it comes!

00:48:18.240 --> 00:48:19.400
It's not stopping!

00:48:21.270 --> 00:48:24.390
It's got to be determination!  I'm gonna stop it with my determination!

00:48:26.310 --> 00:48:27.610
David-san!

00:48:38.590 --> 00:48:39.460
David!

00:48:39.760 --> 00:48:41.050
David, are you alive?

00:48:41.890 --> 00:48:44.420
Snap out of it!  Wake up, David!

00:48:48.030 --> 00:48:49.520
Oh...  Kelly...

00:48:49.900 --> 00:48:53.170
Jeeze, do you think you can do anything if you just scream loud enough?

00:48:54.340 --> 00:48:56.670
Kelly, you're truly beautiful.

00:48:58.040 --> 00:49:00.510
Please marry me... Kelly.

00:49:02.350 --> 00:49:03.880
Oh...  David...

00:49:07.690 --> 00:49:08.550
Souichi...

00:49:11.460 --> 00:49:12.520
Bring it on.

00:49:13.190 --> 00:49:16.900
Your time will be over once you catch up to this AI carrier.

00:49:20.800 --> 00:49:24.720
As long as you're aboard this carrier, they will follow it to the ends of the Earth.

00:49:25.200 --> 00:49:28.380
That's right, you're my trump card.

00:49:29.980 --> 00:49:31.070
Live-eviL!!!!

00:49:31.580 --> 00:49:32.210
Angela!

00:49:32.880 --> 00:49:34.410
Hey, get closer.

00:49:35.050 --> 00:49:37.410
I'm going to shoot the tires and make the carrier fall over.

00:49:37.780 --> 00:49:38.490
You can't do that.

00:49:38.920 --> 00:49:40.990
If you do that, Angela will be hurt.

00:49:41.290 --> 00:49:42.080
Let me make the shot.

00:49:42.520 --> 00:49:43.420
That idiot.

00:49:44.220 --> 00:49:46.140
I have to put a shot in or I won't be satisfied.

00:50:04.930 --> 00:50:05.890
It's a trap.

00:50:05.960 --> 00:50:07.870
It's dangerous to stay at the sides, move to the front!

00:50:34.320 --> 00:50:35.910
Why does he have that car?

00:50:36.360 --> 00:50:38.240
He doesn't have a license,

00:50:38.860 --> 00:50:40.190
he's an eX-Driver failure.

00:50:54.180 --> 00:50:56.200
How ruthless to hit him on purpose!

00:51:06.760 --> 00:51:08.540
Stupid eX-Drivers.

00:51:09.090 --> 00:51:10.810
Go to hell with the carrier!

00:51:23.440 --> 00:51:25.400
Angela is still unconscious.

00:51:26.110 --> 00:51:27.060
I guess I have to do it.

00:51:31.360 --> 00:51:32.390
What do you mean "do it"?

00:51:32.920 --> 00:51:34.980
Detective Ralph, please take the wheel.

00:51:36.090 --> 00:51:36.990
Are you serious?

00:51:37.750 --> 00:51:40.090
Just while I'm on the carrier!

00:51:40.420 --> 00:51:41.580
Don't be stupid!

00:51:42.890 --> 00:51:44.950
What am I supposed to do now?

00:51:53.800 --> 00:51:54.490
Souichi..

00:51:55.370 --> 00:51:58.960
You don't know if you can stop the carrier even if you get in.

00:51:59.240 --> 00:52:00.080
I know.

00:52:00.440 --> 00:52:02.720
In any case, rescuing Angela comes first!

00:52:02.980 --> 00:52:04.590
Souichi-kun, please hurry.

00:52:05.350 --> 00:52:07.310
If we keep going like this we're going to reach a gorge.

00:52:08.250 --> 00:52:10.020
The road is narrow and dangerous.

00:52:10.850 --> 00:52:12.550
Angela, wake up!

00:52:13.660 --> 00:52:14.520
Souichi...

00:52:15.460 --> 00:52:16.430
I've come to rescue you.

00:52:17.130 --> 00:52:17.730
What about Joe?

00:52:18.110 --> 00:52:19.400
He ran off in a car he had stored in the back.

00:52:19.730 --> 00:52:20.250
I see.

00:52:25.530 --> 00:52:26.730
The mountains are closing in...

00:52:27.070 --> 00:52:27.750
Hurry!

00:52:33.110 --> 00:52:36.750
It's no use, the navigation program has been completely erased.

00:52:37.340 --> 00:52:38.470
I can't correct it any more.

00:52:39.080 --> 00:52:40.040
Are you saying we can't stop it?

00:52:40.450 --> 00:52:41.060
Yes.

00:52:41.380 --> 00:52:43.430
I'm sorry Souichi, you're doing this for me, and...

00:52:43.690 --> 00:52:44.280
What's this?

00:52:47.620 --> 00:52:49.700
The folding ramp can still be operated manually.

00:52:50.730 --> 00:52:51.990
We might be able to get out.

00:53:01.640 --> 00:53:04.260
If we head out back there will be a panel to operate the ramp.

00:53:04.870 --> 00:53:05.580
Are you scared?

00:53:05.940 --> 00:53:06.910
Don't treat me like a baby.

00:53:07.810 --> 00:53:09.090
I'll definitely protect you.

00:53:09.780 --> 00:53:10.560
Trust me.

00:53:11.510 --> 00:53:12.100
Let's go.

00:53:12.980 --> 00:53:14.510
What should we do?

00:53:15.080 --> 00:53:16.730
Please wait behind the carrier.

00:53:19.220 --> 00:53:19.880
Are you okay?

00:53:20.490 --> 00:53:21.040
Yeah.

00:53:21.860 --> 00:53:24.780
I'm going to lower the ramp now.

00:53:25.390 --> 00:53:28.850
After that, get the Lotus and the Lancia onto the truck.

00:53:29.900 --> 00:53:30.910
Lorna will take Angela,

00:53:32.000 --> 00:53:33.520
Lisa'll take me.

00:53:34.170 --> 00:53:36.470
I see.  That'll be interesting.

00:54:14.010 --> 00:54:15.060
Angela, come on, quickly!

00:54:22.450 --> 00:54:23.570
Angela, get in!

00:54:40.100 --> 00:54:41.340
Easy, easy!

00:54:49.110 --> 00:54:49.940
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:54:50.010 --> 00:54:50.440
No problem.

00:54:53.380 --> 00:54:55.180
Ahh, I'm gonna fall!

00:54:59.490 --> 00:55:01.190
Don't let go!

00:55:02.460 --> 00:55:03.320
Souichi!

00:55:07.260 --> 00:55:07.910
Thanks.

00:55:08.080 --> 00:55:09.180
Let's get out of here.

00:55:09.680 --> 00:55:10.380
Okay.

00:55:10.450 --> 00:55:12.460
Lisa, Souichi-kun, the ramp...

00:55:12.850 --> 00:55:13.580
What about it?

00:55:13.650 --> 00:55:14.890
It's broken and you won't be able to use it.

00:55:19.020 --> 00:55:20.390
We have another problem.

00:55:20.860 --> 00:55:23.560
This road ends in another three kilometers.

00:55:23.900 --> 00:55:25.060
It's probably a cliff.

00:55:25.800 --> 00:55:26.910
This can't be happening!

00:55:39.810 --> 00:55:41.950
Lisa, jump of the carrier immediately!

00:55:42.920 --> 00:55:44.150
Souichi!

00:55:47.920 --> 00:55:50.870
Let's not waste our time calculating and get the hell out of here.

00:55:51.190 --> 00:55:51.790
It's no good.

00:55:52.160 --> 00:55:55.470
The shock on the Lancia from this height would be too great.

00:55:55.860 --> 00:55:57.890
This is not the time to be worrying about the car!

00:55:58.430 --> 00:55:59.360
Hey, Souichi...

00:56:00.130 --> 00:56:01.630
We'll have a brief chance...

00:56:02.630 --> 00:56:04.960
...when the truck's loading area and the ground are on the same level.

00:56:07.140 --> 00:56:09.110
In order for both us and the car to survive,

00:56:09.880 --> 00:56:11.440
we'll have to aim for that moment.

00:56:14.880 --> 00:56:15.810
Don't take it the wrong way.

00:56:16.520 --> 00:56:17.570
It's just a lucky charm.

00:56:18.080 --> 00:56:20.420
I mean I'm putting my life in a child's hands!

00:56:28.990 --> 00:56:29.960
LIVE

00:56:30.060 --> 00:56:30.790
EVIL

00:56:31.230 --> 00:56:32.220
ROCKS

00:56:32.460 --> 00:56:33.120
FREAK OUT!!!

00:56:48.050 --> 00:56:49.340
Lisa, Souichi!

00:56:50.150 --> 00:56:51.800
Souichi, Souichi!

00:56:52.520 --> 00:56:53.300
Are you alive?

00:56:54.220 --> 00:56:55.910
If you're alive, wake up!

00:56:56.020 --> 00:56:57.470
Huh, what do you want?

00:56:57.860 --> 00:56:59.370
How long do you intend to lie there touching me?

00:56:59.930 --> 00:57:02.050
Oww!

00:57:02.130 --> 00:57:04.370
I don't want to touch you anyway.

00:57:04.700 --> 00:57:05.790
What did you say?

00:57:06.230 --> 00:57:07.740
Did you forget that you were holding on to me?!

00:57:07.460 --> 00:57:08.330
What did you say?

00:57:08.400 --> 00:57:10.070
I simply fell and landed on you by accident.

00:57:09.970 --> 00:57:11.160
You're a pest!

00:57:11.240 --> 00:57:11.860
Shut up!

00:57:11.940 --> 00:57:12.730
You damn brat!

00:57:12.800 --> 00:57:14.880
Sorry, it's always like this.

00:57:14.880 --> 00:57:16.330
Shut your trap, you old hag.

00:57:16.410 --> 00:57:17.500
What do you want, you dwarf?!

00:57:23.720 --> 00:57:25.160
Heh, Heh.  I win.

00:57:25.480 --> 00:57:27.100
I beat the eX-Drivers.

00:57:27.890 --> 00:57:28.350
Huh?

00:57:34.790 --> 00:57:36.990
The criminal's vehicle is approaching, aim!

00:57:41.470 --> 00:57:42.160
Shit.

00:57:48.840 --> 00:57:50.000
After him!

00:57:53.750 --> 00:57:54.940
You're not getting away.

00:57:55.310 --> 00:57:57.370
I'll stay on your tail with the satellite tracking system

00:57:57.520 --> 00:58:00.120
that my girlfriend's father designed.

00:58:08.280 --> 00:58:10.450
The cops can't catch me,

00:58:11.030 --> 00:58:13.530
I'm the man that beat the eX-Drivers.

00:58:21.960 --> 00:58:22.790
There he is!

00:58:23.160 --> 00:58:25.610
Michael's navigation system is pretty accurate.

00:58:26.130 --> 00:58:26.920
I won't forgive you!

00:58:27.490 --> 00:58:29.450
You've soiled the pride of the driver,

00:58:30.070 --> 00:58:31.440
I'll never forgive you.

00:58:35.200 --> 00:58:38.420
You want a match?  Alright, I'll take you on!

00:59:02.670 --> 00:59:04.330
We did it, Souichi!

00:59:13.840 --> 00:59:15.520
You've lost completely.

00:59:22.450 --> 00:59:26.570
Someone who's forgotten love has no right to drive a car.

00:59:29.930 --> 00:59:31.840
Don't underestimate us.

00:59:41.970 --> 00:59:43.560
Arrest him, arrest him!

00:59:43.640 --> 00:59:46.370
Now my father and chief will acknowledge me!

01:00:05.090 --> 01:00:07.740
I've really, really kept you waiting!

01:00:08.060 --> 01:00:14.180
The postponed, and then postponed again eX-Driver final race is going to start, at long last!

01:00:15.000 --> 01:00:16.990
Due to the overwhelming pressure from the fans,

01:00:17.070 --> 01:00:20.230
two cars from the Japanese team have gotten special permission to join the race.

01:00:20.480 --> 01:00:23.880
The Super 7 and the Stratos have entered the final race!

01:00:24.310 --> 01:00:27.010
The reason Wang kidnapped Angela...

01:00:27.180 --> 01:00:28.790
...was to protect her!

01:00:29.150 --> 01:00:31.320
Hmm, who did you hear that from?

01:00:32.220 --> 01:00:33.690
Err, what do you mean who...

01:00:36.460 --> 01:00:38.330
Come to Los Angeles again when you're over 20.

01:00:39.230 --> 01:00:41.390
I'll make you my woman, Lisa.

01:00:41.700 --> 01:00:42.480
See ya.

01:00:43.930 --> 01:00:45.900
Lisa, he just proposed to you, wow!

01:00:48.040 --> 01:00:50.040
That was no proposal,

01:00:50.040 --> 01:00:52.860
proposals are supposed to have more mood and be more romantic.

01:00:53.640 --> 01:00:56.870
When today's race is over we'll have a toast with some California wine.

01:00:56.950 --> 01:00:59.180
Yes, I'd like to go to a bar where we can see the ocean.

01:00:59.250 --> 01:00:59.990
Okay.

01:01:00.880 --> 01:01:03.980
Lorna, the people here are weird.

01:01:07.090 --> 01:01:07.960
Souichi.

01:01:08.320 --> 01:01:08.980
Hey!

01:01:09.760 --> 01:01:12.260
Since then I've talked with my dad I have come to understand everything...

01:01:12.660 --> 01:01:15.780
The feelings of my father who loves me and the eX-Drivers..

01:01:16.100 --> 01:01:16.930
Good.

01:01:17.530 --> 01:01:19.670
I think that this has been a good lesson for myself as well.

01:01:20.840 --> 01:01:22.500
It will take some time...

01:01:22.570 --> 01:01:25.410
...but I plan to put in a lot of effort to make up with Joe.

01:01:26.680 --> 01:01:29.240
Anyway, do your best in today's race.

01:01:30.280 --> 01:01:33.870
If you win I'll let you eat my special pasta dish.

01:01:34.320 --> 01:01:35.110
Yes, sir!

01:01:35.180 --> 01:01:36.980
I'm glad I got to meet you.
